{"seq":2,"slug":"assists-royalties-taxable-apportionment","title":"协助费与特许权使用费的应税判定与分摊方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-valuation-transaction-value-firstsale-engineering/transaction-value-adjustment-firstsale/assists-royalties-taxable-apportionment","wordCount":2889,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"协助费与特许权使用费的应税判定与分摊方法\">协助费与特许权使用费的应税判定与分摊方法</h1><p>一台注塑机的模具由买方在东莞付了 8 万美元、寄给越南的代工厂；一批手袋的商标授权费按零售额的 5% 每季度结算。这两笔钱分属《估价协定》第 8.1 条的加项，但进入完税价格的方式完全不同：模具费要在<strong>首次进口时按总产量足额分摊</strong>，商标费却可能在<strong>货物进口数月之后</strong>才产生申报义务。把两者混成一个「额外费用」字段，是跨境电商估价错报里最贵的一类结构错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-协助的四类法定形态与三要件\">核心概念：协助的四类法定形态与三要件</h2><p>协助（Assist）不是「买方花的与货物有关的任何钱」。它的入口是：买方<strong>以免费或减价的方式</strong>向卖方<strong>提供</strong>某样东西，且该物项被用于<strong>生产进口货物</strong>——物项形态、提供方式、用途指向三要件同时成立才构成第 8.1(b) 条加项，缺一即不构成。该条把这四类物项列成封闭清单，清单外的任何买方支出都不是协助 <a href=\"https://www.wto.org/english/docs_e/legal_e/26-gatt-e.pdf\">WTO, <em>Agreement on Implementation of Article VII of GATT 1994</em></a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条款项</th>\n<th>物项类别</th>\n<th>跨境电商典型场景</th>\n<th>排除项</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>8.1(b)(i)</td>\n<td>并入货物的材料、部件、零件</td>\n<td>买方提供的面料、五金、芯片、内衬</td>\n<td>买方加价卖回给卖方的材料</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8.1(b)(ii)</td>\n<td>生产所用的工具、模具、铸模</td>\n<td>注塑模具、压铸模、治具、测试架</td>\n<td>买方「租借」并按次付费的工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8.1(b)(iii)</td>\n<td>生产过程中消耗的材料</td>\n<td>电镀耗材、喷涂原料、测试晶圆</td>\n<td>卖方自购的常规辅料</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8.1(b)(iv)</td>\n<td>境外完成且为生产所必需的工程、开发、设计、图纸</td>\n<td>境外设计公司外观设计、版型开发、固件</td>\n<td>在<strong>进口国境内</strong>完成的设计开发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两条排除最容易误伤。其一，8.1(b)(ii) 的工具若买方<strong>付费租用</strong>而非免费提供，租金是买方向卖方或第三方支付的款项，要走「价格是否已包含」的判断，而非当作协助成本再分摊一次。其二，8.1(b)(iv) 的设计开发<strong>必须发生在进口国境外</strong>：若设计由进口国团队完成，即便买方付了钱，也不满足「undertaken elsewhere than in the country of importation」的地域要件。因此每项协助必须记录<strong>提供方式</strong>与<strong>完成地点</strong>两个字段，仅凭发票科目名（<code>tooling</code>、<code>design fee</code>）无法判定。买方在国内采购、加价转售给海外代工厂的变形仍构成协助，只是分摊基数要用<strong>买方取得的成本</strong>（含采购价与运至生产地的运费），而非代工厂的入账价——这与 <a href=\"adjustment-additions-deductions-model\">成交价格调整项模型</a> 中「未含则加」的总原则一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"协助分摊-分母是总产量-不是本批数量\">协助分摊：分母是总产量，不是本批数量</h2><p>协助的应税金额不是一次性全部计入首单，而是<strong>分摊</strong>（apportionment）。协定对第 8.1(b) 条的注释规定：分摊应以适合个案的方式进行；若买方要求，可按该协助对应的<strong>预期总产量</strong>分摊 <a href=\"https://www.wto.org/english/docs_e/legal_e/26-gatt-e.pdf\">WTO, <em>Agreement on Implementation of Article VII of GATT 1994</em></a>。落到单件完税价格上：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mtext>unit</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>assist</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>recovery</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>anticipated produced</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_{\\text{unit}} = \\frac{C_{\\text{assist}} - R_{\\text{recovery}}}{N_{\\text{anticipated produced}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">anticipated produced</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">assist</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recovery</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>assist</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{assist}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">assist</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是买方取得该协助的成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>recovery</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{recovery}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recovery</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是可回收部分（模具转售、跨产品线复用的残值），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>anticipated produced</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{anticipated produced}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">anticipated produced</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该协助<strong>预期服务的总产量</strong>。分母必须是总产量：若把 8 万美元模具费全挤进首批 5,000 件，单件完税价会被推高 16 美元，后续批次却分文不计——既违反分摊原则，又在稽查中构成前批少缴、后批多缴的双向风险。三种被接受的口径是：<strong>按预期总产量均摊</strong>（最常用）、<strong>按实际批次递延分摊</strong>（先按预估总量记账，每批按实际数量结转）、<strong>按公平价值分摊</strong>（同一协助服务多种单价悬殊货物时按货值比例分摊）。数据须来自<strong>客观且可量化的数据</strong>（第 8.3 条闸门）：模具采购发票、设计合同、供应商产量报表。若卖方拒绝提供总产量或成本凭证导致无法量化，则该协助无法调整，整票货物的成交价格法资格被动摇，须转入 <a href=\"../customs-valuation-agreement-legal-model/substitute-valuation-methods-selection-order\">替代估价方法的适用序列</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;买方免费/减价提供物项&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;是否第8.1(b)条&lt;br/&gt;四类之一?&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| N1[&quot;非协助·不调整&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| C{&quot;境外完成/&lt;br/&gt;用于生产进口货物?&quot;}&#10;  C --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| N1&#10;  C --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| D{&quot;成本与总产量&lt;br/&gt;可客观量化?&quot;}&#10;  D --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| E[&quot;无法分摊&lt;br/&gt;转用第2-7条方法&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| F[&quot;按总产量分摊&lt;br/&gt;逐批结转&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;计入各批完税价格&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"买方免费/减价提供物项\"] --&gt; B{\"是否第8.1(b)条&lt;br/&gt;四类之一?\"}\n  B --&gt;|\"否\"| N1[\"非协助·不调整\"]\n  B --&gt;|\"是\"| C{\"境外完成/&lt;br/&gt;用于生产进口货物?\"}\n  C --&gt;|\"否\"| N1\n  C --&gt;|\"是\"| D{\"成本与总产量&lt;br/&gt;可客观量化?\"}\n  D --&gt;|\"否\"| E[\"无法分摊&lt;br/&gt;转用第2-7条方法\"]\n  D --&gt;|\"是\"| F[\"按总产量分摊&lt;br/&gt;逐批结转\"]\n  F --&gt; G[\"计入各批完税价格\"]</pre><h2 id=\"特许权使用费的应税判定-相关性与成交条件的叠加测试\">特许权使用费的应税判定：相关性与成交条件的叠加测试</h2><p>特许权使用费（Royalty）与许可费的加项判定，由第 8.1(c) 条规定两个<strong>叠加</strong>条件：其一，该费用<strong>与进口货物相关</strong>（related to the imported goods）；其二，它是买方<strong>作为该货物出口销售成交条件</strong>（a condition of sale of the goods for export）而支付、且未包含在实付或应付价格内 <a href=\"https://www.wto.org/english/docs_e/legal_e/26-gatt-e.pdf\">WTO, <em>Agreement on Implementation of Article VII of GATT 1994</em></a>。两条件用「且」连接，任一不成立即不构成加项。</p>\n<p><strong>条件一：相关性。</strong> 支付是否与进口货物本身挂钩。WCO 估价技术委员会的《估价汇编》（Valuation Compendium）咨询意见反复界定这一边界，如 Advisory Opinion 4.1 系列专门处理商标权使用费与进口货物的关联性 <a href=\"https://www.wcoomd.org/en/topics/valuation/instruments-and-tools.aspx\">WCO Valuation Compendium</a>。一个明确例外是<strong>在进口国境内复制进口货物的权利</strong>：为在进口国复制货物而支付的费用不予加项，因为它关联的是复制行为，不是进口的那批货物本身。</p>\n<p><strong>条件二：成交条件。</strong> 经典判据是「<strong>若不付这笔钱，卖方就不会把货卖给买方</strong>」。若买方能单独获得货物、授权费可选择不付而不影响供货，则不构成成交条件；但若许可协议与销售合同相互挂钩、终止任一即导致供货中断，即便两份合同分册签署，也会被认定为成交条件。第 8.1(c) 条注释另给出排除：<strong>向第三方支付、且不构成销售条件的</strong>转售或分销权使用费不加项——平台佣金、分销许可费若与进口销售条件无绑定，通常不落入加项。落地时以进口国立法为准：欧盟见 UCC 第 70–71 条与实施条例 (EU) 2015/2447 <a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2013/952/oj\">EU UCC, Reg. (EU) 952/2013</a>，美国见 19 CFR §152.103(c)(d) 与 <a href=\"https://www.cbp.gov/trade/rulings/informed-compliance-publications\">CBP, <em>Customs Value</em> ICP</a>，中国见海关总署令第 213 号第十三条。</p>\n<h2 id=\"特许权使用费的分摊与申报时点-进口时不确定怎么办\">特许权使用费的分摊与申报时点：进口时不确定怎么办</h2><p>特许权使用费与协助最大的工程差异在<strong>时点</strong>：协助是买方已付出的成本、进口时可确定；特许权使用费却常按销售额或产量事后结算，进口放行时金额未知。申报制度来补这一缺口：中国海关总署 2019 年第 58 号公告《关于特许权使用费申报纳税手续的公告》给出的路径是，报关时不能确定应付金额的，纳税义务人应当在<strong>每次支付后的 30 日内</strong>向海关申报纳税 [海关总署公告 2019 年第 58 号]。</p>\n<p>分摊到单件时，费用与<strong>具体批次</strong>可对应则直接归属；跨批次、按期间结算的，按该期间<strong>进口货物的数量或货值</strong>分摊：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>unit</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>period</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>period</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{unit}} = \\frac{R_{\\text{period}} \\times \\theta}{Q_{\\text{period}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3435em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">period</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">period</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>period</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{period}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">period</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该结算期支付的使用费总额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 是可归属到进口货物的比例（授权若同时覆盖境内生产、服务等不涉及进口的用途，须先剔除该部分），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>period</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{period}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">period</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该期内对应的进口数量。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 是争议核心：许可协议若将商标授权覆盖进口货物、境内生产、线上服务三类用途，只有与进口货物相关的那一份才加项，其余部分必须能从协议与结算报表中客观切分，否则可量化性不足。</p>\n<p>工程上这要求系统支持<strong>先放行、后补报</strong>的两段式流程：进口时以预估使用费入账（或暂不计入），结算后再做<strong>汇算清缴式的追溯调整</strong>，对差额补税或退税。这是与常规「进口即结清」不同的状态机，账套必须能承载同一批货物的多次调整。</p>\n<h2 id=\"协助与特许权使用费的分野-同一笔技术费判归哪条\">协助与特许权使用费的分野：同一笔技术费判归哪条</h2><p>一笔买方支付的「技术费」可能落入两条中的任一条，判定路径取决于经济实质：换来的是<strong>一件被用于生产的物项</strong>（设计图纸、模具），还是<strong>一项使用的权利</strong>（商标、专利实施许可）？</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>落入 8.1(b) 协助</th>\n<th>落入 8.1(c) 特许权使用费</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>对价性质</td>\n<td>取得/提供了某物项</td>\n<td>取得使用某项权利的许可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型形态</td>\n<td>一次性支付的模具费、设计开发费</td>\n<td>按销售额/期间持续支付的商标、专利许可费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否转移物项</td>\n<td>是（图纸、模具、材料交予生产方）</td>\n<td>否（权利仍归许可方）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分摊基数</td>\n<td>预期总产量</td>\n<td>受益的进口数量或货值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>申报时点</td>\n<td>通常进口时可确定</td>\n<td>常需放行后按结算补报</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中最易误判的是：「限量版外观设计买断费」由买方付给境外设计公司并把图纸转交生产方——这落入 8.1(b)(iv) 协助，按总产量分摊，而非按销售额持续结算的特许权使用费；反之，为使用卖方商标按零售额付费，只要对价核心是<strong>持续使用商标的权利</strong>，就落入 8.1(c)。买方佣金与卖方佣金的区分（属第 8.1(a) 条却常与协助混同）同理：买方雇人替自己采购而付的报酬不加项，卖方为促成销售付给中间人的报酬要加项，判据是<strong>谁是委托人、钱付给谁、服务对谁负责</strong>，详见 <a href=\"adjustment-additions-deductions-model\">成交价格调整项模型</a>。</p>\n<p>系统里两者必须是独立字段（<code>assist</code> 与 <code>royalty</code>）。协助对象至少要有 <code>item_class</code>、<code>provided_free_or_reduced</code>、<code>produced_for_imported_goods</code>、<code>completed_abroad</code>、<code>cost_basis</code>、<code>recoverable_value</code>、<code>anticipated_total_units</code>、<code>apportioned_to_shipment</code>、<code>evidence[]</code>；特许权使用费对象至少要有 <code>related_to_goods</code>、<code>condition_of_sale</code>、<code>included_in_price</code>、<code>allocation_base</code>、<code>attributable_ratio θ</code>、<code>settlement_period</code>、<code>declaration_deadline</code>、<code>evidence[]</code>。可量化性判定、分摊公式与申报时点三者都不同——用一个 <code>fees</code> 数组会把三种规则压成一种，必然错报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>协助</strong>入口是「买方免费或减价提供」+「四类物项之一」+「用于生产进口货物」，三要件齐备才构成第 8.1(b) 条加项；设计开发还须在<strong>进口国境外</strong>完成。</li>\n<li>协助分摊分母是<strong>预期总产量</strong>而非本批数量；可回收残值要扣减；无法客观量化则触发第 8.3 条出局，转用第 2–7 条方法。</li>\n<li><strong>特许权使用费</strong>须同时满足「与进口货物相关」且「构成成交条件」两个叠加条件；进口国境内复制权、非成交条件的分销权使用费不加项。</li>\n<li>特许权使用费常在<strong>放行后</strong>按结算补报（如支付后 30 日路径），须支持两段式申报与追溯调整。</li>\n<li>协助与特许权使用费是两条规则，<strong>必须建成两个独立对象</strong>：对价性质、分摊基数、申报时点三者皆不同。</li>\n<li>落地以进口国立法为准：欧盟 UCC 第 70–71 条与实施条例 2015/2447、美国 19 CFR §152.103、中国海关总署令第 213 号与 2019 年第 58 号公告。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"协助费与特许权使用费的应税判定与分摊方法","id":"协助费与特许权使用费的应税判定与分摊方法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：协助的四类法定形态与三要件","id":"核心概念-协助的四类法定形态与三要件"},{"level":2,"text":"协助分摊：分母是总产量，不是本批数量","id":"协助分摊-分母是总产量-不是本批数量"},{"level":2,"text":"特许权使用费的应税判定：相关性与成交条件的叠加测试","id":"特许权使用费的应税判定-相关性与成交条件的叠加测试"},{"level":2,"text":"特许权使用费的分摊与申报时点：进口时不确定怎么办","id":"特许权使用费的分摊与申报时点-进口时不确定怎么办"},{"level":2,"text":"协助与特许权使用费的分野：同一笔技术费判归哪条","id":"协助与特许权使用费的分野-同一笔技术费判归哪条"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"成交价格调整项模型：法定加项与减项的界定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-valuation-transaction-value-firstsale-engineering/transaction-value-adjustment-firstsale/adjustment-additions-deductions-model"},"next":{"title":"first-sale 规则与追溯估价的凭证链工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-valuation-transaction-value-firstsale-engineering/transaction-value-adjustment-firstsale/first-sale-for-export-retrospective-valuation"}}